---Start generating a dispatch
---
---Starts generating a dispatch: collects checkpoints from the selected repos' home cell, persists a setup + run, then hands the LLM call to a detached background task and returns immediately. 202 with Location pointing at the run's own read route; the response body is the same dispatch shape the read routes serve, with status generating and no markdown yet — poll getDispatch for the result. Rate-limited to one generation per account per minute. A selected repo with no local placement, or one the caller can't currently see, 404s naming it; org scopes are not yet supported.
---
---`POST /api/v1/me/dispatches`
---@param input? entire.me.GenerateDispatchRequest
---@return entire.me.DispatchDetailWire? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:generate_dispatch(input) end

