---Your sessions across all repositories
---
---**Accepted credentials:** User token.
---
---Your sessions from every repository, gathered from your checkpoint activity and merged into one list ordered globally across repositories. Each row carries its repository's route provider (github/entire); a repository with no resolvable provider is dropped and reported via meta.partial rather than linked to a guessed surface. This list has no cursor: it returns up to `limit` rows inside the timeframe and no `next_cursor`; narrow the timeframe or raise `limit` to see more. `kind[ne]` excludes sessions of the given kinds before the limit is applied, so a page is not displaced by rows the caller would hide; sessions with no kind are always included.
---
---Use an own-account bearer token (including supported service accounts). Plugin installation tokens are not accepted for this action. Plugin assertion JWTs and plugin OAuth user-delegation tokens are not accepted here.
---
---Requires an account subject; automation principals are rejected. Results are limited to the caller and filtered by repository access.
---
---`GET /api/v1/me/sessions`
---@param input? entire.me.ListMySessionsRequest
---@return entire.me.MeSessionsOutputBody? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:list_my_sessions(input) end

